  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Breadcrumbs",
    "Usage",
    "Shows the user’s location in a navigational hierarchy and allows quick jumps to ancestors. Use for deep page trees, not for linear progress (see Stepper) or single-level flows (omit entirely).",
    "Accessibility",
    "Wrap the trail in <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"> and render as an ordered list.\nMark the current item with aria-current=\"page\" — never link it.\nSeparators are decorative: aria-hidden=\"true\".\nKeyboard: Tab moves between links, Enter activates. Ellipsis menu: Arrow keys to navigate, Esc to dismiss.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Mirror your site's real hierarchy\nDO   Use 'multiple' for deep paths — keep first + last visible\nDO   Make every non-current item a real link\nDO   Keep labels short and match the destination page title",
    "DON'T   Link the current page\nDON'T   Use Breadcrumbs as primary navigation\nDON'T   Mix Breadcrumbs in some views and omit in others\nDON'T   Insert the app name or a Home icon mid-trail"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
}
